                            <comment id="17387328" author="alex_pl" created="Mon, 26 Jul 2021 12:51:12 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Reproducer:&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
    &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; void testBinaryConfiguration() &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;throws&lt;/span&gt; Exception {
        &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;try&lt;/span&gt; (Ignite ignite = Ignition.start(Config.getServerConfiguration())) {
            Ignition.startClient(&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; ClientConfiguration().setAddresses(Config.SERVER)
                .setBinaryConfiguration(&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; BinaryConfiguration().setTypeConfigurations(Collections.singleton(
                    &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; BinaryTypeConfiguration(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;test&quot;&lt;/span&gt;)
                ))));
        }
    }
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17387366" author="ivan.fedorenkov" created="Mon, 26 Jul 2021 13:56:02 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=alex_pl&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;alex_pl&quot;&gt;alex_pl&lt;/a&gt; could you please guide me what is the process of contributing the fix? I have already downloaded the source code and registered in the dev list, however I am unable to assign the ticket to myself.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17387398" author="alex_pl" created="Mon, 26 Jul 2021 14:48:15 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ivan.fedorenkov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ivan.fedorenkov&quot;&gt;ivan.fedorenkov&lt;/a&gt;, I&apos;ve added you to the contributors list, now you can assign tickets to yourself. About this ticket, do you have any draft implementation? I already have made a fix for it and wrote some tests. If you didn&apos;t start to work with this ticket yet and wish to contribute, perhaps it&apos;s better to take another ticket.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17387402" author="ivan.fedorenkov" created="Mon, 26 Jul 2021 14:53:06 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Got it! Thank you Aleksey. I would be more than happy if someone fixes this instead of me&#160;&lt;img class=&quot;emoticon&quot; src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/emoticons/smile.png&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; align=&quot;absmiddle&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;/&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
